

### İşletme oluştur — beklenen: 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/businesses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Deniz Bilgisayar"
}

### Boş işletme adı — beklenen: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/businesses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   "
}


###
@businessId=aa38a347-93e8-418d-ac2b-055ff0e57e7e



### İşletmeyi kimliğiyle getir — 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/businesses/{{businessId}}
Accept: application/json

### Olmayan işletme — 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/businesses/cf185839-ec3e-4428-8f11-ae15d21106f9
Accept: application/json
